[en.FOCUS_C12_IMPROVING_MINE_SANITATION_CONDITION]
Improve Mine Condition

[en.FOCUS_C12_IMPROVING_MINE_SANITATION_CONDITION_desc]
Previously, the accident rate in the mines had been alarmingly high, and many ponies were reluctant to venture into the depths to extract metals and ores unless absolutely necessary. With new technologies and regulatory bodies in place, we can ensure the safety of the miners and improve mining efficiency.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_IMPROVING_MINE_SANITATION_CONDITION]
改善矿洞条件

[zh.FOCUS_C12_IMPROVING_MINE_SANITATION_CONDITION_desc]
此前矿洞的事故发生率居高不下，除非迫不得已，许多小马都不愿意前往矿洞挖掘金属和矿石，只要有了新的技术和监管部门，我们可以保障矿工们的安全性并且提高挖掘效率。

